        "text": "(C.37)"
      },
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_master.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 93911,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 4510,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 2036,
        "paragraph_id": "5EB83419",
        "text": "In both cases MF is the morphological factor used to accelerate morphological changes. In the first case, the sediment in the bottom is conserved in all cases, but changes in the amount of sediment in the water are not considered; one can also say that the sediment in suspension is added to the bottom sediment. In the second case, the storage of sediment in the water is accounted for, but will be distorted in cases of high MF. Since under most circumstances the real effect of the storage in the water phase is small we prefer the first formulation which guarantees mass conservation in the bottom. Both formulations are calculated using an explicit scheme, see also (C.38)."
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_master.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 94072,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 4513,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 2039,
        "paragraph_id": "061537A4",
        "text": "Avalanching"
      },
      {
        "container_path": "models/XBeach/raw/source_code/trunk/doc/manual/XBeach_manual_master.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 94083,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 4514,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 2040,
        "paragraph_id": "77045109",
        "text": "XBeach implements avalanching as described in Section 2.8.2. It first calculates bed level change due to avalanching in the cross-shore dimension. It then calculates the slopes in alongshore direction and bottom change due to avalanching in this direction. To avoid disrupted sediment balance XBeach does not calculate bottom change due to avalanching at the boundary grid cells. Consequently XBeach cannot calculate avalanching at the lateral boundary."
      }
    ],
    "table_cell": null,
    "text_method": "Saved display-field substitution plus w:t; equation objects are not transcribed."
  },
